---
<!-- ===================== PLANOS ===================== -->
<section class="section" id="planos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;place-items:center">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Planos</span>
        <h2 class="reveal d1">Escolha o nível de apoio ideal para o seu momento.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="plans">
      <div class="plan reveal d1">
        <h3>Essencial</h3>
        <p class="pdesc">Para organizar a rotina financeira básica da empresa.</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="pending">Sob consulta</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Contas a pagar e receber</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Conciliação bancária</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Relatório mensal simples</li>
          <li class="config">• Limites operacionais: a definir</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-ghost">Solicitar proposta</a>
      </div>
      <div class="plan feat reveal d2">
        <span class="badge">Mais procurado</span>
        <h3>Profissional</h3>
        <p class="pdesc">Controle completo com visão gerencial para decidir melhor.</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="pending">Sob consulta</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Tudo do Essencial</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Fluxo de caixa projetado</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Relatórios gerenciais completos</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Indicadores de desempenho</li>
          <li class="config">• Limites operacionais: a definir</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-primary">Solicitar proposta</a>
      </div>
      <div class="plan reveal d3">
        <h3>Avançado</h3>
        <p class="pdesc">Controladoria e acompanhamento próximo para operações maiores.</p>
        <div class="price"><span class="pending">Sob consulta</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Tudo do Profissional</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Múltiplas empresas / centros de custo</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg> Reuniões gerenciais periódicas</li>
          <li class="config">• Limites operacionais: a definir</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contato" class="btn btn-ghost">Solicitar proposta</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="text-align:center;margin-top:22px;font-size:.84rem;color:var(--gray-dim)">Valores, limites de lançamentos e escopo exato são definidos conforme a proposta comercial da Candidus.</p>
  </div>
</section>
